cal", "mixedreality", "shooter"], "long_description": "CLICK CLACK MR is the first mixed reality shooter built with AI by a dev who doesn't know how to code.\n100% vibes. 10,000% fun. Zero programming. Just AI, Unity, and a wild dream.\n\nYour house is the battlefield.\nDodge, shoot, breach doors, rescue hostages, and search suspects \u2014 all inside your own real-world space.\n\nFEATURES:\n\ud83d\udfe9 Hostage Rescue \u2013 Breach, clear, and save the VIP. But beware\u2026 some enemies hide in plain sight.\n\ud83d\udfe5 Shoot-Out \u2013 Endless wave survival with \u201cDoubleTap Respawn.\u201d Be the Baba Yaga.\n\ud83c\udfaf Target Practice \u2013 Scatter targets around your space for fast-paced drills.\n\ud83e\udd86 Ducks \u2013 Yep. There are ducks. And they\u2019re in your living room. Take em out! \n\nThis is an Early Access release. Big updates coming soon:\n\u2705 Custom Map Builder\n\u2705 Local Co-Op Mode\n\u2705 More chaos, more doors to kick, more vibes\n\nBuilt with AI. Played with courage.\nTake doors.\nClickClackMR.com", "short_description": "CLICK CLACK MR is the first mixed reality shooter built with AI by a dev that doesn't know how to code! 100% Vibes. \nBreach, dodge, shoot, and survive as enemies storm your real-world space. Search suspects for weapons, rescue hostages and more!\nNo levels to load. Your room is the battlefield.\n\nThis is an Early Access release \u2014 with Map Builder and Local Co-op coming soon.\nTake Doors! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://ClickClackMR.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lopes Media LLC", "support_website_url": "http://ClickClackMR.com/", "website_url": "http://ClickClackMR.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_